Package: getaca
Title: Reproducible External Data Dependencies for R Packages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Gilles", "Colling", email = "gilles.colling051@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3070-6066"))
Language: en-GB
Description: Declares, retrieves, verifies, tracks and actively manages
    external data dependencies for R packages. Resources are identified by
    package, name and version, pinned to a SHA-256 checksum, and resolved
    through an explicit policy so that the same installed package always
    resolves the same bytes. Designed for reproducible offline use and
    graceful behaviour during R package checks.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://gillescolling.com/getaca/, https://github.com/gcol33/getaca
